2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Predictive Forecasting of Care Load and Placement Demand

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Objective: forecast future care load and discharge demand using historical daily data.

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Data preparation included missing-date handling, feature engineering, and time-series cleaning.

5
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Models included moving averages, exponential smoothing, regression, and random forest forecasting.

6
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:08,000
The Streamlit app presents key metrics, forecast charts, model comparison, and downloadable results.

7
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Learning outcome: practical experience with time-series forecasting, model evaluation, and dashboard design.
